# The golden scripts and the SVG they draw are compared byte for byte, so they
# keep LF line ends on every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says.
#
# Force-add this file when committing (git add -f): an ignore rule covering
# dotfiles would otherwise leave it untracked, and a Windows checkout with
# core.autocrlf on - the CI runner's - would hand every golden over as CRLF.
test/scripts/** text eol=lf
# The PNG golden beside them is a picture: no line ends to normalize, and
# marked as text Git would strip the CR bytes its pixels happen to hold.
test/scripts/**/*.png binary
